{"version":1,"key":"card:252","content":{"id":252,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad4d8fc2-c977-4fd1-ac88-0858e3392fd1","children":[{"type":"content-link","contentId":5353,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":686,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"2582de93-783c-414e-83e3-1c6cf4c692f0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是用来判断某个对象是否是某个函数的实例，如果该函数在这个对象的原型链上，那么这个对象就是这个函数的实例。在 ES6 中，我们可以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.hasInstance"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来改变这一默认行为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e503d404-8d41-4a9b-8736-242ce204bace","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"653a4ea7-ae7d-4bcd-bbea-079f83f4f044","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"obj instanceof Array;\n// 相当于\nArray[Symbol.hasInstance](obj);","collabId":"591f5c76-f360-4b0b-98b4-053b4c9f8456","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f122f4d0-a94a-4d93-8fb4-10fe0a3bf1b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过改变构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.hasInstance"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，即可改变这一行为。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"386765e0-883b-4a32-8d03-71b692a55488","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1908e3ac-8a04-4e14-8d4d-b7845440f25e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"必须通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperty"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来重写 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.hasInstance"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b7748030-493d-4872-980a-ba0bf30a0705","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"03d078c2-ac43-445d-803b-f9396722a379","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n}\n\nlet alice = new Person(\"alice\");\n// 默认行为\nconsole.log(alice instanceof Person); // true\n\n// 更改 instanceof 行为\nObject.defineProperty(Person, Symbol.hasInstance, {\n  value: function (instance) {\n    return false;\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(alice instanceof Person); // false","collabId":"56da0f79-2452-481c-95ab-84d6a4d424b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f8abb7cf-fd64-4520-85b5-c1ecbad3bee3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.hasInstance"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法接收一个参数，这个参数就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 前面的那个对象"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol","JavaScript/原型","JavaScript/instanceof"],"createTime":1690986265004,"updateTime":1772030700771,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1772030700771},"links":{"card:686":{"key":"card:686","type":"card","id":686}}}